---
import { Heart, ShieldCheck, Gem, Sparkles } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section id="nosotros" class="py-24 bg-primary-light relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative background elements -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute top-[10%] left-[-10%] w-80 h-80 bg-accent/3 rounded-full blur-[90px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Visual Artwork (CSS Shape & Premium Image) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-2 lg:order-1 relative flex justify-center">
        <!-- Frame decoration -->
        <div class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 w-20 h-20 border-t border-r border-accent/20 rounded-tr-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 w-20 h-20 border-b border-l border-gold/20 rounded-bl-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

        <!-- The Image Wrapper utilizing shape-organic-2 -->
        <div class="relative w-[300px] sm:w-[400px] aspect-square">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-gold/15 to-accent/15 filter blur-2xl -z-10"></div>
          
          <div class="w-full h-full overflow-hidden shape-organic-2 border border-gold/15 shadow-2xl relative group">
            <img 
              src="/images/about.png" 
              alt="Interior de Aura Nail Atelier" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover scale-105 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/20"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Content -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 order-1 lg:order-2 flex flex-col items-start space-y-8">
        <!-- Small subtitle -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-accent"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-sans tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-accent font-medium">Nuestra Filosofía</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Section Title -->
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-wide text-secondary font-light">
          Un santuario de calma <br />
          <span class="text-gradient-rose italic font-normal">dedicado a tus manos.</span>
        </h2>

        <!-- Description -->
        <p class="font-sans text-secondary-muted text-base tracking-wide font-light leading-relaxed">
          Creemos que el cuidado de tus manos no debe ser un trámite rápido ni ruidoso. Nos alejamos de la prisa de los salones convencionales para ofrecerte una experiencia íntima, silenciosa y sumamente detallista. 
        </p>
        <p class="font-sans text-secondary-muted text-base tracking-wide font-light leading-relaxed">
          Cada sesión es un ritual personalizado. Nos tomamos el tiempo necesario para esculpir y mimar tus uñas utilizando productos seleccionados de la más alta calidad, respetuosos con tu salud y con el medio ambiente.
        </p>

        <!-- Bullet highlights -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-6 w-full">
          <!-- Item 1 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col items-start space-y-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-primary/30 border border-secondary/5">
            <Heart class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" />
            <h3 class="font-sans text-sm tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-secondary font-medium">Cuidado Consciente</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-secondary-muted/80 leading-relaxed">Uso exclusivo de esmaltes y productos no tóxicos y cruelty-free.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 2 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col items-start space-y-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-primary/30 border border-secondary/5">
            <ShieldCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" />
            <h3 class="font-sans text-sm tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-secondary font-medium">Bioseguridad</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-secondary-muted/80 leading-relaxed">Esterilización hospitalaria de todo nuestro instrumental médico.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Item 3 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col items-start space-y-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-primary/30 border border-secondary/5">
            <Gem class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" />
            <h3 class="font-sans text-sm tracking-[0.1em] uppercase text-secondary font-medium">Arte de Autor</h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-secondary-muted/80 leading-relaxed">Diseños personalizados adaptados a tu estilo y fisonomía.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Founder Quote -->
        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-secondary/5 w-full">
          <blockquote class="font-serif text-lg italic text-accent-light/90 leading-relaxed">
            "La belleza real no compite, se expresa sutilmente en los pequeños detalles de precisión. Tus manos dicen todo sobre vos."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-3">
            <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-gold" />
            <span class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary font-semibold">Valentina</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary-muted">— Fundadora y Nail Artist</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
